# CPU job (plans/caps.md, addendum 2026-10-04): pull method, pull score, 38 annotate, 38 seqscore, reading
# the discover half's synced reads from input/xl-latent-s1/test-read/ (its out/xl-latent-s1/, fetched as an
# input artifact) and the Job V pretrain record, writing out/xl-latent-s1/results/. No GPU work.
# Sizing: the xl scoresweeps peaked at 41–48 GiB resident on the session target and annotate peaked at
# ≈ 1.8× the scoresweep at l → ≈ 75–85 GiB expected, a 256 GiB host under the 2× rule; first measured
# at xl by this run (the caps addendum asks for one measured cell — this is it, seed 0 first).
# One command per line; the runner's cwd is the harness directory; set -e stops at the first failure.
set -euo pipefail

python -m seq2causebench.pull --repo chadyuk/trace-bench --revision v0.3.0 --rung xl --variant latent --seed 1 --tier method --dest corpora --output-folder out/xl-latent-s1/pull-method

